thread:
maya: Hey folks — planning a low-key Sundown Sips this Friday on the rooftop at 6pm. Thinking relaxed vibes, some sparkling sodas + mocktails, and a tiny plant swap for anyone who wants to trade succulents or small pots. Bring one if you want, but totally optional. :herb: :sparkles;

maya: Quick logistics: rooftop has space for ~30, we'll bring a couple foldable stools. Weather looks clear. If you need a ride home, reply here and we can carpool.;

tom: In! I can bring a box of sparkling yuzu sodas. :yum:;

keerthi: Count me in. I have an extra little haworthia to swap. Also happy to grab some compostable cups.;

jordan: Sounds great — can we make sure there's a non-alc option beyond soda? Prefer tonic or ginger beer.;

maya: yes — non-alc for sure. thanks for the heads up.;

liam: I might be ~15 min late (train), still ok?;

maya: totally fine, we'll hold a spot.;

events-bot: FYI: rooftop booking confirmed by Facilities. Max capacity 30. Noise curfew at 9pm. Please keep music low after 8:30.;

sophia: RSVP: :thumbsup: — bringing a little string-of-pearls to swap. Also can bring a small cheese platter if folks want.;

tom: @maya could we set up a small sign with "Sundown Sips"? might be helpful for guests coming from street level.;

maya: good idea. I'll put a sign by the elevator.;

jordan: tiny question — are dogs allowed? my partner might bring our quiet corgi.;

events-bot: Pets allowed on rooftop only if leashed and well-behaved; owners responsible for cleanup.;

keerthi: I can bring a little bag of soil if anyone needs repotting supplies.;

liam: RSVP: :wave: — late but in. Also can bring a deck of cards for low-key games.;

maya: awesome. Quick poll for time swap possibility — reply with 1 for 6pm (current), 2 for 5:30 (earlier).;

sophia: 1;

tom: 1;

keerthi: 2 (prefers earlier but ok with 6);

jordan: 1;

liam: 1;

maya: looks like 6pm wins. final details: rooftop, bring a small plant if you want to swap, BYO drink if you want alcohol, we'll provide a few non-alc mixers. Sign-up link for food helps so we don't overbuy: https://tiny.redwood/sundown-sips (just put your name + what you're bringing).;

tom: link filled. thanks! :thumbsup:;

sophia: thanks maya — see you Friday! :herb::sparkles:;

maya: Thanks everyone! If anyone needs a ride DM me. ❤️
